{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.markov_trace_factors","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.markov_trace_factors","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L75-L83","doc":"**Downstream conditional theorem (AGENTS.md §3b-cond).**\nConditional on `[KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing R]`, the Markov trace\nof any closed braid factors through the Frobenius pairing with\nthe knot factor.  Fully verified by Lean once an instance is\nfixed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.factorisation_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.factorisation_holds","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L71-L71","doc":"**Conjectural factorisation.**  For every braid `b`, the\nMarkov trace equals the Frobenius pairing with the knot\nfactor.  A concrete instance discharges this by `sorry` (the\nconjecture); downstream theorems condition on it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.knot_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.knot_factor","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Canonical knot-factor element (a closed braid associated to\neach `n`).  Acts as the \"structural unit\" of the Frobenius\npairing in the factorisation below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.frobenius_pairing_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.frobenius_pairing_q","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Frobenius pairing on H_n(q). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.markov_trace_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.markov_trace_q","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Markov trace at parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.mk","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing","kind":"class","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L40-L73","doc":"**Conjecture class.**  An instance asserts the existence of:\n* a Markov-trace functional `markov_trace_q` for any closed\n  braid at any strand count;\n* a Frobenius pairing `frobenius_pairing_q` on the same Hecke\n  algebra;\n* a structural identification `factorisation` showing the\n  Markov trace equals the Frobenius pairing of the braid with\n  a canonical \"knot factor\" element.\n\nThe factorisation is the conjecture proper; a concrete instance\ndischarges `factorisation_holds` with `sorry` (the conjecture)\nand is then usable downstream as a class hypothesis.\n\nThe Markov trace / Frobenius pairing of `H_n(q)` are q-deformation\ncombinatorics valued in the coefficient ring — no ordering, radical,\nor analytic construct — so the base ring is a generic\n`{R : Type*} [CommRing R]` with the parameter `q : R` (§7c); the\narchimedean substrate `R := ℝ` is a downstream instantiation. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:knot-factor-frobenius-pairing","label":"conj:knot-factor-frobenius-pairing","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/knot-factor-frobenius-pairing.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instInhabitedClosedBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instInhabitedClosedBraid","kind":"instance","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L35-L38","doc":"The empty-word closed braid is the default at every strand count\n(the identity braid). Provides `default` for the skeleton instance\nbelow. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ClosedBraid.word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ClosedBraid.word","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ClosedBraid.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ClosedBraid.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ClosedBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ClosedBraid","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KnotFactorFrobeniusPairing.lean#L29-L33","doc":"A closed braid datum at strand count `n`: a braid word in\n`B_n` recorded as a list of generator indices (positive for\nσ_i, negative for σ_i⁻¹). ","signatureChunk":0}]}